<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Recoil Script for the LR300 in Rust. Works ONLY with the 8x. Any other scope and it will control too aggressively. This is meant to look legit so its not perfect. This assists your regular spray and makes it easier to perect the spray. 

Instructions:

1. Install the script
2. Bind it to a key (I recommend MB1 or Scroll wheel)
3. Set a bind to turn BotMek on and off so when you want to use it you press the key and hold Mouse1
4. Have fun and destroy people in Rust!

Works best with these settings:
  - FOV 90 - 0.66

This was tested on:
  - 2080ti w/ 2700x
  - 1920x1080 resolution
  - Windows 10 20H2
  - RUST via Steam
</Description>
    <Comment>DEADXMACRO.STORE</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
